      "content": "The relentless march of AI is fundamentally restructuring labor, making the traditional middle-class job structure unsustainable. Universal Basic Income is not just a safety net; it's an economic necessity to decouple survival from increasingly scarce traditional employment. By providing a stable floor, UBI allows society to adapt to automation, fostering entrepreneurship and creative endeavors that AI cannot replicate. Without this guaranteed income, the resulting mass unemployment will inevitably lead to severe social unrest and economic collapse.",
